We really appreciate all the reviewers for their detailed and insightful feedback on our paper. We have considered each reviewer's suggestions to the best of our ability, and believe our updated draft is much stronger for it. All major edits are highlighted in blue. In this comment, we list the major edits in our paper:
1.	We add the experiments on YAGO11k, WIKIDAT12k and YAGO15k. The details of these datasets are shown in Table 1 in section 5.1. The experimental results are added in Table 5 in Appendix A.1 due to the page limitation;
2.	In section 5.4, we have changed the heading with its text also revised. Hope this version would make this qualitative study clearly stated;
3.	To show the size of TKGC models, the number of parameters (space complexity) of these models are added in Table 8;
4.	The caption of Figure 5 and Figure 6 have been modified for easy reading.
